## bestFiveHundredVolumeLogRatioXVolume
- **Wzór:** $\log\left(\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{N} Q^{\text{bid}}_i}{\sum_{i=1}^{N} Q^{\text{ask}}_i}\right)\cdot \left(\sum_{i=1}^{N} Q^{\text{bid}}_i+\sum_{i=1}^{N} Q^{\text{ask}}_i\right)$ (N=500)
